n aliens, though. despite them looking much more like people). \n\nthis game will be infinitely better if you get at least one friend to play it with. the jank, ragdolls, absurd story elements, preschool level dialogue, all of it is enhanced when you have someone else to enjoy it with. all of the classes are fun too. ranger is simple (and goated), fencer is a hypermobile slug, wingdiver is... wingdiver i hardly play her, and air raider is the troglodyte's best friend (positive).\n\n10/10, use the free bike on ranger and install the loot master mod if you value your mental state", "timestamp_created": 1781423081, "timestamp_updated": 1781423081, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.481153011322021484", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 28, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "227919398", "author": {"steamid": "76561198883332455", "personaname": "Nut Brain", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tsuminopremium/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6684, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5669, "deck_playtime_at_review": 75, "last_played": 1783221364, "avatar": "6889e542266ff1eca9c32d7f405a723a0e19f756"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has a lot of bugs", "timestamp_created": 1781407939, "timestamp_updated": 1781407939, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}